[align=center][size=xx-large][b]MyStudio 2.1.0[/b][/size]
[size=large]A file-based theme studio and modern dark theme for MyBB 1.8[/size]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amtekkie/mystudio/main/docs/screenshots/forum-index.png[/img][/align]

[hr]

[size=large][b]What is MyStudio?[/b][/size]

MyStudio changes how you build MyBB themes. Your theme lives as [b]ordinary files[/b] (HTML templates, CSS, JavaScript, JSON) instead of rows in a database. Edit them in the built-in code editor or your own, press save, and MyStudio syncs them into MyBB for you.

It ships with [b]MyStudio Default[/b], a responsive dark theme built on Bootstrap 5, and five modules that add the features members ask for most.

[hr]

[size=large][b]What's new in 2.1.0[/b][/size]

This release is about trust. We audited the whole plugin, theme and module code base and fixed what we found.

[b]Security[/b]
[list]
[*]Template content now passes MyBB's own template security check on every save, sync and import, the same rule the stock Admin CP enforces.
[*]Theme ZIP imports are locked down: only web assets may land in [i]themes/[/i], core modules can't be replaced, archives are size- and count-limited, and an import can no longer overwrite a different theme's folder.
[*]Theme editor file operations validate every path before touching the disk.
[*]Page Builder content is checked before it is rendered, and page conditions use a strict whitelist.
[*]Feed posting, replies, likes, quick search and profile "latest posts" now respect forum permissions, passwords and "view own threads only" forums.
[*]Editor image uploads attach to the right post (including when editing) and outside images are only fetched when you paste or drop them, through a hardened downloader.
[*]Admin CP permissions are now granted properly, so every administrator, not just super admins, can use MyStudio. Demo data only runs on development sites.
[/list]

[b]Speed[/b]
[list]
[*]Like counts load in a single query per page instead of two per post.
[*]Forum icons are cached and only processed where they appear.
[*]Fewer file-system scans and database checks on every page load.
[*]The unread-PM poller only runs for members and pauses in background tabs.
[/list]

[b]Fixes[/b]
[list]
[*]Typed text is no longer black on the dark editor background.
[*]Inline moderation checkboxes no longer leave an empty column for regular members.
[*]The likes feature works even when the portal is switched off.
[*]Profile "Remove avatar" works again.
[*]Theme import and export no longer need PHP's zip extension: MyStudio falls back to a built-in ZIP handler.
[/list]

[b]Documentation[/b]
Brand-new beginner guides: getting started, how the theme system works, creating a theme, and creating a module. Links below.

[hr]

[size=large][b]The theme[/b][/size]

A clean dark layout with a sidebar, card-style forum listings, last-poster avatars and a quick user card.

[align=center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amtekkie/mystudio/main/docs/screenshots/forum-thread-list.png[/img]

